# Proposed by the swarm (2026-10-14, from the product owner's day on the trunk); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: framed on Safari, with Mail docked out of view. Mail plays a video full screen. Arbor is paused for a game.
# The video ends: macOS gives Mail the frame it had, which is the corner Arbor kept it in. A moment later it is
# in view all the same, although Arbor is paused.
# Reference: F40, F30.
open Safari
open Mail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
zoom 101
expect hidden 102
fullscreen 102 on
pause
fullscreen 102 off
wait 1
expect visible 102
expect visible 101
resume
expect docked 102
